This software is provided for authorised personal and enterprise use on Windows. By installing this software you agree to the following terms:\par
\par
\b 1. Use\b0\par
Chum captures meeting audio and uses AI language models to provide real-time assistance. You are responsible for ensuring that your use of Chum complies with applicable laws in your jurisdiction (including any recording-consent requirements) and with the policies of your employer and the platforms you use.\par
\par
\b 2. Privacy\b0\par
Chum processes audio in real time and does not persistently store raw audio. Transcript data is held in memory only for the duration of the session unless you explicitly opt in to persistent storage. When cloud AI providers are used, excerpts of the meeting transcript are transmitted to those providers under their respective privacy policies.\par
